<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZSE warns Underground of suspension.</title>
<headline>NZSE warns Underground of suspension.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Zealand Stock Exchange Market Surveillance Panel said on Tuesday Underground Fashions had not issued its annual result within 75 days of its year end, and warned its shares would be suspended if it failed to comply within five days.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
